{"id":887672,"title":"Q7｜通用Agent：未来是否具备存在价值？","content":"<blockquote>\n<p>作者介绍：向邦宇，阿里巴巴代码平台负责人</p>\n</blockquote><p><span class=\"orange\">Q：通用 Agent 会随着模型能力的增强而失去价值吗？</span></p><p><span class=\"orange\">(注：以下内容截取自向邦宇的文章《从“人驱动”到“模型驱动”：聊聊 Agent 在 2025 年的爆发与挑战》，若有异议，请以文章内容为准）</span></p><p><strong>向邦宇：</strong>最近有一种观点认为，Agent 会被模型取代，认为“模型即应用”。  但我的判断是：通用 Agent 并不会被取代。通用 Agent 与模型之间是一种共生的关系——<strong>Agent 像为模型这个“大脑”装上了“手脚”，赋予了它行动（Action）的能力</strong>。只要保持 Agent 架构的简洁性，并且不通过流程编排来限制模型的能力，Agent 就能够随着模型能力的提升变得更加强大和通用。实际上，Agent 会直接受益于模型泛化能力的提高。</p><p>目前，模型的结构和推理能力存在着固有的局限，而 Agent 正好可以帮助模型应对环境感知、记忆存储以及工具使用等一系列系统性的问题。“大脑”般的模型自身无法长出手脚去采取行动，通用 Agent 实质上就是一个为模型装备行动器官的技术解决方案。</p><p>甚至通用 Agent 还可能会产生规模效应，通过工程技术让模型具备持续反思和学习的能力，而这正是现有模型结构所无法实现的。</p><p>然而，随着模型能力的不断提升，那些以工作流（Workflow）为核心的专业 Agent 确实有可能被淘汰。因为现在许多专为人工编排设计的功能，在将来很可能可以由模型自动完成。这种更高层次的自动化编排能力，将会使某些专业 Agent 失去存在的意义。</p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401520,"user_name":"Geek_1ed796","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":4301500,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"6AB79D6A06722E","user_header":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/9sOqZ3H77jZdTQucfCRGicJ4ElFd9y4zeeFnhnfnx8UAHibXu82hxuyobnNM3EFqsVs5E4SpIRZ4GjECXPnt9YtA/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1752481677,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101055501,"comment_content":"工作流和Agent的本质区别是什么？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1013309,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/76/3d/8120438b.jpg","nickname":"3.141516","note":"","ucode":"34AF71B02692F3","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":true},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668547,"discussion_content":"工作流是人工编排流程，agent 是AI 自己编排流程。因为 AI 编排流程现在还没有做到最佳，所以一些场景需要人工编排","content_length":60,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1752595921,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":1,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":1414971,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/97/3b/c98b68c1.jpg","nickname":"AngryApe","note":"","ucode":"E0125A8D2AC84B","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1013309,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/76/3d/8120438b.jpg","nickname":"3.141516","note":"","ucode":"34AF71B02692F3","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":true},"discussion":{"id":668606,"discussion_content":"flow 是将各个 node 用line 连接起来形成【有逻辑有组织】的关系， agent 相当于node， 大模型本身可以替代掉连接的工作，因为大模型会根据上下文即时地去建立这个关系，替代传统的人工【逻辑 &amp; 组织】 工作","content_length":116,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1752728752,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":668547,"ip_address":"浙江","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":668606,"extra":""}]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":403901,"user_name":"enjoylearning","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1000237,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"DCAF8538DEA277","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1765291110,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101055501,"comment_content":"由模型自动规划路径那就对提示词提出了高要求","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":402007,"user_name":"雾凇","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":3971198,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"326E69185302CD","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3c/98/7e/e0311392.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1755081538,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":5,"score":2,"product_id":101055501,"comment_content":"哪有什么通用agent，都是靠模型","like_count":0}]}